<title>USA: Hewlett-Packard consolidates sales segments.</title>
<headline>Hewlett-Packard consolidates sales segments.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Co said it is consolidating sales and channel-management activities within its Computer Organization and realigning segments of the organization's operating units.</p>
<p>It said the move is aimed at increasing focus on emerging and growing markets, including electronic commerce and other opportunities created by the Internet.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the consolidation included no layoffs.</p>
</text>
